        <h3 class="model-title">The Westminster</h3>
        <p>Perry's "English design," drawn for the steep, wooded lots. It was built of fieldstone and shingle, with a one-car garage close to the road and a terrace in front. Steps led up from the front vestibule into a large living room with windows on three sides. <em>Architectural Forum</em> listed one at $7,950.</p>
