        <h3 class="model-title">Other Perry houses</h3>
        <p>Not every house matched a named plan. <em>Architectural Forum</em> showed a long one-story Cape with two bedrooms on the ground floor, priced at $5,975, and a brick-fronted Cape with a front porch and a separate garage. Perry told <em>American Builder</em> that of the first forty houses, "each one is different," because most were built to order and "each prospect virtually becomes an architectural client."</p>
